{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1436092,
  "courseSlug": "react-native-the-practical-guide",
  "courseTitle": "React Native - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31435386",
      "title": "Previewing Picked Locations",
      "lectureOrder": 207,
      "videoOrder": 201,
      "sourceHash": "ff41ce9e2dac3b4a36da7fadef1d198b5df4954fe3ce75cfb7666194326f9a90",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.05,
          "end": 3.69,
          "en": "So now we need to deal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.69,
          "end": 7.55,
          "en": "with a location that was picked on this Map screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.55,
          "end": 11.01,
          "en": "once we're back on this PlaceForm screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.01,
          "end": 13.07,
          "en": "or in the PlaceForm component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.07,
          "end": 16.42,
          "en": "which is loaded by the AddPlace screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.42,
          "end": 19.22,
          "en": "Ultimately, it's still the LocationPicker component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.22,
          "end": 20.95,
          "en": "in which we wanna work though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.95,
          "end": 23.95,
          "en": "There we are interested in getting the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.95,
          "end": 25.11,
          "en": "from the Map screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.11,
          "end": 28.24,
          "en": "because there we have this preview for the location,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.24,
          "end": 31.11,
          "en": "which we wanna update after a location was picked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.11,
          "end": 32.81,
          "en": "on the Map screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.81,
          "end": 35.47,
          "en": "Now, how can we get access to the data provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.47,
          "end": 39.07,
          "en": "by the Map screen from inside this component though?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.07,
          "end": 42.92,
          "en": "With help of another hook provided by React Navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.92,
          "end": 45.23,
          "en": "We can use the useNavigation hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.23,
          "end": 47.23,
          "en": "which we are already using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.23,
          "end": 49.84,
          "en": "to get hold of the navigation object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.84,
          "end": 53.14,
          "en": "which helps us to navigate, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.14,
          "end": 56.74,
          "en": "We can also use the useRoute hook here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.74,
          "end": 59,
          "en": "to get hold of route parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59,
          "end": 62.95,
          "en": "So of data passed from another screen to this screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.95,
          "end": 65.18,
          "en": "We don't have to do this in this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.18,
          "end": 67.95,
          "en": "We could do it in another component as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.95,
          "end": 71.69,
          "en": "and then pass data to the LocationPicker through props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.69,
          "end": 74.68,
          "en": "But since this picker will only be used in a place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.68,
          "end": 76.82,
          "en": "where we wanna have that functionality",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.82,
          "end": 79.36,
          "en": "of picking locations on a map,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 79.36,
          "end": 83.14,
          "en": "we can also simply extract the route parameters directly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.14,
          "end": 85.93,
          "en": "in this LocationPicker component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.93,
          "end": 88.40299999999999,
          "en": "Therefore, besides calling useNavigation here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.31,
          "end": 93.6,
          "en": "I will also call useRoute to get my route object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.6,
          "end": 96.05,
          "en": "And that route object can then be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 96.05,
          "end": 98.893,
          "en": "to get my parameters, my route parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99.72999999999999,
          "end": 101.66,
          "en": "Now, I'll do that here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.66,
          "end": 103.34,
          "en": "I will add a constant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 103.34,
          "end": 106.64,
          "en": "The mapPickedLocation let's say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.64,
          "end": 110.64,
          "en": "where I check if route.params is truthy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 110.64,
          "end": 112.47,
          "en": "So if we do have route.params,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.47,
          "end": 114.8,
          "en": "which will be the case if we are coming back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 114.8,
          "end": 117.56,
          "en": "from the Map screen but which will not be the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.56,
          "end": 121.38,
          "en": "when we first visit the AddPlace screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 121.38,
          "end": 123.43,
          "en": "So if I'm coming from the starting screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 123.43,
          "end": 125.37,
          "en": "and I land on this screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 125.37,
          "end": 128.05,
          "en": "then we won't have any route parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 128.05,
          "end": 131.03,
          "en": "because then no parameters are passed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 131.03,
          "end": 133.133,
          "en": "as part of the screen navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 133.97,
          "end": 136.445,
          "en": "But if we are coming back from the Map screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 136.445,
          "end": 138.28,
          "en": "after picking a location,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 138.28,
          "end": 141.43,
          "en": "then we will have route parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 141.43,
          "end": 143.31,
          "en": "But that's why I'm checking this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 143.31,
          "end": 145.32,
          "en": "if route.params is truthy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 145.32,
          "end": 150.22,
          "en": "And if it is, then my PickedLocation will be an object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 150.22,
          "end": 153.6,
          "en": "an object where I set a lat property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 153.6,
          "end": 156.457,
          "en": "which should be equal to route.params.pickedLat.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 158.11,
          "end": 160.47,
          "en": "pickedLat because in the Map screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 160.47,
          "end": 162.32,
          "en": "when going back here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 162.32,
          "end": 166.953,
          "en": "we are setting a pickedLat and a pickedLng property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 166.953,
          "end": 170.03,
          "en": "So these two properties can be extracted now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 170.03,
          "end": 172.93,
          "en": "and here I'm extracting the pickedLat property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 172.93,
          "end": 177.93,
          "en": "And then lng is set equal to route.params.pickedLng.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 179.61,
          "end": 181.2,
          "en": "Else after this object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 181.2,
          "end": 184.11,
          "en": "we don't have any route parameters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 184.11,
          "end": 186.36,
          "en": "so then my mapPickedLocation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 186.36,
          "end": 188.12,
          "en": "should be null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 188.12,
          "end": 189.8,
          "en": "And hence we can also shorten this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 189.8,
          "end": 192.25,
          "en": "just as we do it sometimes in JSX.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 192.25,
          "end": 194.23,
          "en": "We can use the and operator here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 194.23,
          "end": 198.11,
          "en": "to only set mapPickedLocation equal to this object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 198.11,
          "end": 200.02,
          "en": "if route.params is truthy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 200.02,
          "end": 201.853,
          "en": "otherwise it will be undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 202.78,
          "end": 206.57,
          "en": "So now mapPickedLocation might contain such an object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 206.57,
          "end": 208.75,
          "en": "depending on whether we got that data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 208.75,
          "end": 210.52,
          "en": "from the route.params or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 210.52,
          "end": 212.81,
          "en": "And if we do have this object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 212.81,
          "end": 216.403,
          "en": "we, of course, wanna use those parameters to show a preview.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 217.47,
          "end": 219.07999999999998,
          "en": "Now, to show a preview, I,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 219.07999999999998,
          "end": 221.337,
          "en": "in the end, wanna set my PickedLocation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 221.337,
          "end": 223.95,
          "en": "because that is what I did before as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 223.95,
          "end": 226.113,
          "en": "when we located the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 227.07999999999998,
          "end": 230.96,
          "en": "Therefore, we can add useEffect here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 230.96,
          "end": 234.94,
          "en": "the normal useEffect hook imported from React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 235.89,
          "end": 237.89,
          "en": "to register a side effect,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 237.89,
          "end": 240.78,
          "en": "so to execute some code conditionally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 240.78,
          "end": 242.7,
          "en": "In this side effect here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 242.7,
          "end": 246.67,
          "en": "I wanna check if mapPickedLocation is truthy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 246.67,
          "end": 249.44,
          "en": "So if we do have an object in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 249.44,
          "end": 251.2,
          "en": "and if that's the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 251.2,
          "end": 254.72,
          "en": "I want to set my PickedLocation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 254.72,
          "end": 257.263,
          "en": "equal to this mapPickedLocation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 258.32,
          "end": 261.35,
          "en": "Now, PickedLocation is set to an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 261.35,
          "end": 266.35,
          "en": "with lat and lng here in the locate user scenario as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 267.72,
          "end": 270.47,
          "en": "And I have an object with a similar shape now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 270.47,
          "end": 272.65,
          "en": "if a location was picked on the map.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 272.65,
          "end": 276.86,
          "en": "So I can set my state to this mapPickedLocation object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 276.86,
          "end": 280.403,
          "en": "which also has this shape with lat and lng here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 281.46,
          "end": 283.08,
          "en": "So with that, I'll update my state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 283.08,
          "end": 285.76,
          "en": "whenever we got new route parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 285.76,
          "end": 287.71,
          "en": "And my only dependency here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 287.71,
          "end": 292.04,
          "en": "is this mapPickedLocation constant here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 292.04,
          "end": 295.983,
          "en": "The effect should rerun whenever the value here changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 297.06,
          "end": 300.06,
          "en": "With that, we should be able to update the preview",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 300.06,
          "end": 302.47,
          "en": "once we pick the location.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 302.47,
          "end": 305.94,
          "en": "If I pick a location on my map here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 305.94,
          "end": 309.263,
          "en": "I go back but it's not reflected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 310.27,
          "end": 311.76,
          "en": "Why?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 311.76,
          "end": 314.24,
          "en": "So we have the problem that our location here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 314.24,
          "end": 315.79,
          "en": "our preview is not updated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 315.79,
          "end": 318.803,
          "en": "even though we picked a place on the map.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 319.67,
          "end": 322.47,
          "en": "Now, the reason for that is that actually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 322.47,
          "end": 325.31,
          "en": "when we go back from a screen to another screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 325.31,
          "end": 327.44,
          "en": "so when we go back from the Map screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 327.44,
          "end": 329.462,
          "en": "to the AddPlace screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 329.462,
          "end": 332.62,
          "en": "that AddPlace screen, that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 332.62,
          "end": 337.39,
          "en": "and all its child components is not recreated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 337.39,
          "end": 339.74,
          "en": "Instead, when using the Stack Navigator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 339.74,
          "end": 341.67,
          "en": "and you go from one screen to another,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 341.67,
          "end": 344.62,
          "en": "that new screen is simply pushed on top",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 344.62,
          "end": 346.22,
          "en": "of the stack of screens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 346.22,
          "end": 348.197,
          "en": "but all the other screens,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 348.197,
          "end": 350.53,
          "en": "for example, the AddPlace screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 350.53,
          "end": 353.4,
          "en": "when going to the Map screen is preserved.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 353.4,
          "end": 355.423,
          "en": "The component is kept around.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 356.38,
          "end": 359.36,
          "en": "If we then go back to the AddPlace screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 359.36,
          "end": 362.68,
          "en": "the AddPlace component is not recreated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 362.68,
          "end": 365.57,
          "en": "and neither are its nested child components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 365.57,
          "end": 369.633,
          "en": "like PlaceForm or ultimately, the LocationPicker component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 370.7,
          "end": 374.06,
          "en": "Because of that, the component is not reevaluated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 374.06,
          "end": 376.853,
          "en": "and our effect function doesn't run again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 377.92,
          "end": 378.9,
          "en": "To work around that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 378.9,
          "end": 381.03,
          "en": "there is another useful hook we can use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 381.03,
          "end": 382.88,
          "en": "from React Navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 382.88,
          "end": 385.183,
          "en": "It's the useIsFocused hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 386.24,
          "end": 390.21,
          "en": "This hook can be called like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 390.21,
          "end": 392.74,
